.DS_Store
.claude/

# The full-resolution original of Matt's photo, 7.5 MB. The web version that
# the site actually uses is static/media/matt_wyoming.jpg, 64 KB. There is no
# reason to publish the original through GitHub Pages, so it stays local. The
# smaller sources (riley.mat, ion_logo.png) are committed, since they are the
# records of where the palette and the logo came from and they cost nothing.
matt_wyoming.png

# Working file for editing the site's words elsewhere. Regenerated on demand
# from the HTML, which stays the source of truth, so committing it would just
# create a second copy free to drift out of sync.
site-copy.md

__pycache__/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dropbox collision artifacts. Never commit these; they are sync accidents.
# BOTH spellings are required. On 2026-07-29 Dropbox named a conflict copy of
# a .git directory ".git 2", which the "conflicted copy" pattern does not
# match, and 483 of its files were committed to place-decoding before anyone
# noticed. Enforced by checks/check_repo_hygiene.py.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*conflicted copy*
.git [0-9]*
